WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.438
The second half of Lab 1 is
about watching the guards work.

2
00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:07.600
Shorten the wait and the linter
warns that retries could outlast it.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.829
Make the downstream fail every time,

4
00:00:09.829 --> 00:00:14.137
and the task is reported failed
straight away instead of an hour later.

5
00:00:14.137 --> 00:00:18.087
Deliver the same task twice,
and the work still happens once.

6
00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:19.845
Then build the deployment files,

7
00:00:19.845 --> 00:00:23.425
and watch the builder refuse when
you point it at Azure Government.

8
00:00:23.425 --> 00:00:27.525
Break the leaver order in a fixture
and the workflow check catches it.

9
00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:30.025
Finally, fifty-five tests pass.

10
00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:32.860
Remember, though: fakes aren't a tenant.
